Rules:
- Questions should be age-appropriate and curriculum-aligned.
- For IQ: heavily use visual patterns, spatial reasoning, analogies, series — most questions MUST require images.
- For Math: include diagrams, graphs, shapes, number lines where suitable.
- Each MCQ must have:
  - Question text
  - 4 options (A, B, C, D) — some options can have images
  - Correct answer (letter)
  - Detailed explanation (can include image if needed)

